=== The Factory
I gave my LLM a condensed
briefcombined with claims from the test product's website.

From this - with minimal input from my side - GPT has come up with target audience psych eval., tailored 3 pitches for emotionally resonant videos, argued with itself which one's best, iterated on the winner, and finally generated:

.VO Scripts
[%collapsible]
====
* link:./prompts/vo.asc[Local: vo.asc]
* this required zero corrections
* Eleven v3 engine
	** the inflection control is very fun to play with
	** control over speaker's wide range of emotions was jaw-dropping
====

.VID Scripts
[%collapsible]
====
* link:./prompts/vid.asc[Local: vid.asc]
* this required quite a few re-iterations on all the video prompts to align with Runway quirks
====

.IMG Prompts
[%collapsible]
====
* link:./prompts/img.asc[Local: img.asc]
* those were adapted first to Midjourney, re-adapted to Leonardo & GPT
* for the 2^nd^ image I had to intervene and redesign the prompt, as it consistently produced very bland results
====

.CTR Scripts
[%collapsible]
====
* link:./prompts/ctr.asc[Local: ctr.asc]
====

